{"summary":".projekt is a new minimalistic puzzle game about shadows and silhouettes","description":".projekt is a new minimalistic puzzle from creator of Evo Explores.\n\n.projekt requires you to look at things differently. Playing .projekt is like taking a geometry lessons but in a fun and relaxing way.\n\n.projekt is a great training for your creativity. Imagine how an object looks like from a different point of view to match a silhouette.\n\n.projekt is a relaxing experience. There are no ads, no highscores and no time pressure. Nothing will distract you from pure meditative gameplay.\n\nFeatures:\n- New AUGMENTED REALITY mode (ARCore support is required)\n- 120 mind-blowing levels and more to come…\n- No ads and no in-app purchases\n- Achievements","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CTWqwmWocko?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fOYS8VqV-MiusFiHBJ7pu-_Uk_qpSjeAsxzBnD34V2g_LKBJotaXZHmmbAto7ws7hS0tZqK_4mnRu5REWA7-","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BbWQsco3WsJyNZL2iubdfunasGwW5WL9rnEvpDR7Vbuelzz04hAznssMW42e0ZwUILj1XnIqEfy42KXY7L-f","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OdGjbzeBSYycmfATJU3Zg-e2Ag3vzKLm2ssYIgdGDbjHYYX6D05PGJooYMJC4r2jp-xRZPiAuisUX2pzFBbt","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Nab7WlW6UvTZTPT_25V80IXnx7v8e4ubPiRaQfnEB77wD7H_GFggTi53KprTiY1r9gXpVRCv96HmBRsnBUXmcw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KufvjIzqzDc0L0NJ-Dr6ixwtkThSSes9rQevujPfuE5qh0HM8KRmYV596391nXktct7ONxQKTvoMoeE0zvmhfg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wXxx5uSWcmiJkk3leDuHv9kCX3TdZV1O0RR8-OKXdepSms-fAPfQ12HDMaQ5hNxAElrP__ju8WGLLNuDAZa6h5M","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5Jnhu6zJ0zJG7SX90NaxsmN41QK0b-mHfCeBHrqxv6U13kG1WODOlZmn1W0ChRrAh24DJwaHHArADcZBL2GBtQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BbWQsco3WsJyNZL2iubdfunasGwW5WL9rnEvpDR7Vbuelzz04hAznssMW42e0ZwUILj1XnIqEfy42KXY7L-f","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OdGjbzeBSYycmfATJU3Zg-e2